   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "0d791c6305115aaa246d",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h1><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">Portrait photography</span></h1><p class=\"sqsrte-large\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\"><strong>Time is precious and fleeting, one day you will wish you had more photos of you as you are now.</strong> </span></p><p>People get portraits for many reasons. To celebrate and record a milestone, to leave a precious memory for their family or just because they enjoy it. We can do portraits almost anywhere. We can do them in your house or somewhere special to you or we could get into a studio for a more formal look. </p><p>It all starts with an idea. We would love to sit and chat to you about what you are thinking, how we can make that happen but also how we can add value and ideas to really bring out the very best of you. They say that we don’t know what we don’t know. Well, that’s why you talk to us. We can make suggestions on how to ramp things up to the next level to go from nice pictures to AMAZING!</p><p>I have been shooting portraits for years and in that time, I have done a bunch a really creative and classic images that make the person look and feel amazing. I like to think I am a pretty friendly guy too (check some of my awesome <a href=\"/testimonials\" target=\"_blank\">feedback</a>). Having someone who is not just a photographer but also your cheer leader can bring the best out in your photos. In the studio I am great at shaping the light for the most flattering portraits, but I also know the best poses for your body type. I will send you posing guides in advance of the shoot so you can do your homework and come ready to smash them out of the park. </p><p>I have been shooting portraits for over 10 years, here is a small selection of my work.</p>",
